{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type UseMutateAsyncFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = MutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L437","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-query/src/types.ts:437"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutateAsync"},{"type":"text","value":", as returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMutation"},{"type":"text","value":". Similar to "},{"type":"link","href":"UseMutateFunction.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"UseMutateFunction"}]},{"type":"text","value":", but returns a\npromise which can be awaited."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type your mutation function resolves to."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your mutation function may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvariables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TVariables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the variable passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutateAsync"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tonmutateresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOnMutateResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutate"},{"type":"text","value":", passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onError"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSettled"},{"type":"text","value":" as\ntheir "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tvariables","text":"TVariables","level":3},{"id":"tonmutateresult","text":"TOnMutateResult","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UseMutateAsyncFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = MutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:437](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L437)\n\nThe type of `mutateAsync`, as returned by `useMutation`. Similar to [UseMutateFunction](UseMutateFunction.md), but returns a\npromise which can be awaited.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutateAsync`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UseMutateAsyncFunction\ntitle: UseMutateAsyncFunction\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UseMutateAsyncFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = MutateFunction<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:437](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L437)\n\nThe type of `mutateAsync`, as returned by `useMutation`. Similar to [UseMutateFunction](UseMutateFunction.md), but returns a\npromise which can be awaited.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutateAsync`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n"}
